      "answer": "The coefficient of friction is $\\frac{4}{3}$.",
      "official_mark_scheme_text": "$R = mg \\cos \\alpha = 9.6m$ — B1; allow use of $\\alpha = 16.3^\\circ$ throughout.\n\n$T = mg$, $F = mg \\sin \\alpha + T$ — M1, resolving forces on P and Q and eliminating T, or considering equilibrium of the system.\n\n$F = mg \\sin \\alpha + mg = 12.8m$ — A1.\n\nUse of $F = \\mu R$ — M1.\n\nCoefficient of friction $= 1\\frac13 = 4/3$ — A1, AG, so must be from exact working.\n\nPrinted total: 5.",
